 a live graph…","Import and export the Playground's supported RDF/XML subset: OWL classes, datatype properties, object properties with cardinalities, and internal rdfs:subClassOf hierarchies. The importer accepts typed elements and the…","Sign in with GitHub (device flow) and submit your ontology to the community catalogue directly from the designer — the app forks the repo, creates a branch, commits the RDF + metadata, and opens a pull request…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0ed870b4146839da702934d163c1ba3c859ee433c1bcfa43560319cb41389309","extractedAt":"2026-10-13T02:14:26.061Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T02:14:26.061Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Try it live → microsoft.github.io/Ontology-Playground","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in with GitHub (device flow) and submit your ontology to the community catalogue directly from the designer — the app forks the repo, creates a branch, commits the RDF + metadata, and opens a pull request automatically.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0ed870b4146839da702934d163c1ba3c859ee433c1bcfa43560319cb41389309","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T02:14:26.061Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-17T18:51:55Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/microsoft/Ontology-Playground/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T02:14:26.063Z","hash":"0ed870b4146839da702934d163c1ba3c859ee433c1bcfa43560319cb41389309","originalBytes":13564,"storedBytes":13564,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["ontology","github","catalogue","rdf","docs","designer","guide","build","export","microsoft","school","azure","fabric","learning","npm","playground",